{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22352","headline":"只役骆口驿喜萧侍御书至兼覩新诗吟讽通宵因寄八韵 · 白居易","name":"只役骆口驿喜萧侍御书至兼覩新诗吟讽通宵因寄八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日暮心无憀，吏役正营营。\n忽惊芳信至，复与新诗幷。\n是时天无云，山馆有月明。\n月下读数徧，风前吟一声。\n一吟三四叹，声尽有余清。\n雅哉君子文，咏性不咏情。\n使我灵府中，鄙恡不得生。\n始知听韶濩，可使心和平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}